<title>USA: Analysts Int'l to offer year 2000 technology.</title>
<headline>Analysts Int'l to offer year 2000 technology.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts International Inc said Monday it reached an agreement to license Viasoft Inc's year 2000 technology and services to help its customers manage the century date change.</p>
<p>Viasoft's Enterprise 2000 product offers inventory analysis, planning, testing and implementation for year 2000 projects.</p>
<p>Viasoft, based in Phoenix, Ariz., provides technical and consulting services.</p>
<p>Terms of the agreement, defined as a strategic alliance, were not disclosed.</p>
<p>	    ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
